{"id":68250,"date":"2025-09-17T07:33:54","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T06:33:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68250"},"modified":"2026-10-28T14:10:32","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T13:10:32","slug":"sao-silvestre-viana-do-castelo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-viana-do-castelo\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Viana do Castelo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Viana do Castelo 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Viana do Castelo 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente designada Crediversos 13\u00aa Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre de Viana do Castelo) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Avenida dos Combatentes da Grande Guerra<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Viana do Castelo<\/strong>. Limitada a 2.000 participantes, a prova ilumina a noite minhota com duas partidas desfasadas: a corrida principal \u00e0s <strong>18:30<\/strong> e a caminhada \u00e0s <strong>18:40<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra a competitiva corrida pedestre de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (10.000 metros) e uma <strong>caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> n\u00e3o cronometrada, num percurso cont\u00ednuo pelas principais art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas da capital do Alto Minho, entre a frente ribeirinha da foz do <strong>rio Lima<\/strong> e o sop\u00e9 do <strong>Monte de Santa Luzia<\/strong>. Podes planear os teus parciais na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e consultar mais eventos de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">Corridas 10 km<\/a> ou o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-viana-do-castelo\/\">corridas em Viana do Castelo<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovida conjuntamente pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Viana do Castelo e XLife Events<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros da geral masculina e feminina (at\u00e9 500 \u20ac para os vencedores), pr\u00e9mios para as tr\u00eas melhores equipas e realiza ainda o tradicional sorteio de um pr\u00e9mio de 500 \u20ac entre todos os participantes que cortem a meta. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida dos Combatentes da Grande Guerra, Viana do Castelo<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2n